[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5152918883","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120610#issuecomment-5152918883","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120610","id":5152918883,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABMyNNYw","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-01T18:56:23Z","updated_at":"2026-08-01T18:56:23Z","body":"We have consensus that the functionality of targeting a bone's global pose in the skeleton is useful.\r\n\r\nI would prefer a more verbose name like `use_global_bone_pose` instead of `global`\r\n\r\nWe need to try it on more cases. For example common cases are like adding extra arms to characters that might assume global transform, so we should test some combination of global and local\r\n\r\ni also had a question about if one bone observes the global pose of another bone updated in the same CopyTransformModifier instance","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5152918883/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5172565168","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120610#issuecomment-5172565168","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120610","id":5172565168,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNE8UsA","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-03T22:49:23Z","updated_at":"2026-08-03T22:49:23Z","body":"> i also had a question about if one bone observes the global pose of another bone updated in the same CopyTransformModifier instance\r\n\r\n@lyuma Just like with IK, the settings are iterated through in that order, rather than accumulating and applying the transformations.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nvoid BoneConstraint3D::_process_modification(double p_delta) {\r\n\tSkeleton3D *skeleton = get_skeleton();\r\n\tif (!skeleton) {\r\n\t\treturn;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < (int)settings.size(); i++) {\r\n\t\tfloat amount = settings[i]->amount;\r\n\t\tif (amount <= 0) {\r\n\t\t\tcontinue;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tint apply_bone = settings[i]->apply_bone;\r\n\t\tif (apply_bone < 0) {\r\n\t\t\tcontinue;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tif (settings[i]->reference_type == REFERENCE_TYPE_BONE) {\r\n\t\t\tint reference_bone = settings[i]->reference_bone;\r\n\t\t\tif (reference_bone < 0) {\r\n\t\t\t\tcontinue;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t_process_constraint_by_bone(i, skeleton, apply_bone, reference_bone, amount);\r\n\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\tNodePath pt = settings[i]->reference_node;\r\n\t\t\tif (pt.is_empty()) {\r\n\t\t\t\tcontinue;\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t_process_constraint_by_node(i, skeleton, apply_bone, pt, amount);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAs long as set/retrieve pose operations are performed within `_process_constraint_by_node()`, the order remains consistent.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5172565168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5247562589","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120610#issuecomment-5247562589","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120610","id":5247562589,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOMdzXQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T00:21:39Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T00:21:39Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5247562589/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]